{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And this is the work of the Menorah</b> — וזה rises to 18, for the height of the Menorah was 18 handbreadths." "<b>As the vision</b> — כמראה in gematria is כגבריאל (like Gabriel), teaching that Gabriel showed him the form of the Menorah." "<b>So he made</b> — כן is 10 Menorot that Solomon made. עשה in gematria is שלמה. Four times Menorah is mentioned, for it is valid from four types, as stated in Menachot fol. 28. And a hint to four menorot at the Simchat Beit HaSho'eivah."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {2 "The phrase 'בי׳ המנורות' appears to mean 'ten menorot'; the leading bet may be a preposition or part of the numeral, translated here as the count itself following his argument."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:32.241209686Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}